        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Young witch Schubia Wanzhaar turns Neustadt upside down! From Aunt Mania's witch book, she tried out a very special spell that was forbidden and caused a huge chaos in the whole city. Great fun for Schubia, a nightmare for the citizens of Neustadt. And everyone thinks Bibi Blocksberg is the culprit. Now it's up to you: slip into the role of Bibi and uncover the error! To do this, you must try to undo the whole mess.",
